Arm c is .NET Framework 4.8 on Mono 6.8.0.105. That it runs at all is why the
manifest reader here is a hand-written JSON parser (`src/Harness/Json.cs`) and
not `System.Text.Json`: the latter is not in the box on net48, so taking it
would either restrict conformance to arm a or add a package to the floor arm and
change what the floor arm IS.

